> {ui zei pi'o} means (and why we would want it) is beyond me.
>
>
> As with any lujvo, the meaning would have to be looked up in the
> dictionary. The form is available, but that doesn't mean it will be used.
>
>
> My understanding of the cumulative effect of dotside is that every *name*
> must be surrounded by glottal stops
>
>
> A common misunderstanding, but still a misunderstanding.
